              "complete_word_support": "QuantitySupport preserves at least-two distinct labels, nonempty distinct positions and original guard/error order; full lexical Cartesian enumeration. wordCharacterization and wordsDistinct establish exact length/held-label coverage and uniqueness. Empty strings remain legal labels/positions; no new scientific guard.",
              "distinction_pairs": "QuantityPairs retains nonempty/duplicate support guard and positional i<j traversal with original nonidentity filter. acceptedPairs proves the filtered output is precisely the complete positional list for admitted support. pairSources/pairDifferent/pairsDistinct/pairsCover/reverseExcluded establish endpoint provenance, no self pairs, no duplicate records, unordered coverage and one orientation per pair.",
              "information_profile": "QuantityProfile checks duplicate observation keys and exact support-key equality before distinction_pairs, preserving failure order and empty observation labels. lookupUnique/imageExists/imageOfRow prove exact guarded dictionary image and total definedness; default image branch cannot occur for admitted support. Source-first firstLabels preserve original class order. profileData/profileExists retain all fields; profilePartition and membership theorems prove disjoint/exhaustive exact equality partition. fineRetainsPair/fineClosesNone and coarseningPreservesClosed/coarseningOnlyLoses prove the original fine/coarsening laws.",
              "distinction_position_trace": "QuantityPositions executes all original prefix/suffix products for each position, testing both first held labels against the complete support. positionCheckPasses/traceChecksPass/admittedTrace prove every check succeeds for admitted support and output is exactly the original position-ordered one-Fold-distinction trace. Support validation errors propagate. traceLength/traceMembership prove one unit per retained position.",
              "compose_support": "QuantitySupport keeps original nonempty-only guard and ordered Cartesian word concatenation, including raw duplicate/empty-word/variable-length behavior. compositionMembership retains both source coordinates. QuantityPositions.traceComposition proves concatenated position provenance.",
              "SPEC.induction": "firstPositionWords gives exact one-position label support; admittedTrace gives its single unit. positionSuccessorOrder proves exact append-every-label extension order at every finite depth. independentPosition and positionAlternativesDistinct prove each held prefix/suffix realizes distinct label alternatives. traceSuccessor preserves all previous unit records and appends the fresh record. Complete pair coverage/uniqueness applies at every generated successor support.",
              "SPEC.dimensions/witnesses/controls": "Complete original512 nine-axis product, exact source order/IDs/forms/reasons, exhaustive enumeration, coordinate rejection and unique survivor. All five original operational witness computations pass kernel proof; laws/induction/exclusions/control records retained.",
